[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2581.109, "timestamp": "00:43:01", "text": "壘包，像是那些重壘包"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2591.03, "timestamp": "00:43:11", "text": "。是的。根據。  根據。  呃，基地。有一個。藍色標記是底色。我已經下達了命令。  各位，我看到屍體了。這是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2593.67, "timestamp": "00:43:13", "text": "你們嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2601.19, "timestamp": "00:43:21", "text": "好吧，我離提取物很近，因為我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2609.19, "timestamp": "00:43:29", "text": "萃取物在哪？  我懂了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2610.83, "timestamp": "00:43:30", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2612.55, "timestamp": "00:43:32", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2613.91, "timestamp": "00:43:33", "text": "我們得手動進入這個基地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2616.39, "timestamp": "00:43:36", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2619.51, "timestamp": "00:43:39", "text": "DSS。哦，DSS 又恢復正常了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2621.99, "timestamp": "00:43:41", "text": "。  是的，DSS已經修好了。我們就是這樣打敗了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2631.109, "timestamp": "00:43:51", "text": "好的。我討厭這種自然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2633.349, "timestamp": "00:43:53", "text": "現象，因為它就像是納帕爾"}]